sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Juror
    participant Client as Jury Client
    participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
    participant Room as Jury Room Service
    participant Vote as Voting Service
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Result as Verdict Service
    participant Case as Case Service
    participant Analytics as Analytics Service

    Room-->>WS: Open final voting phase
    WS-->>Client: Request verdict and reason

    Juror->>Client: Select Guilty or Not Guilty
    Juror->>Client: Select reason
    Juror->>Client: Add optional explanation

    Client->>WS: Submit final vote
    WS->>Vote: Submit vote with room and user IDs

    Vote->>Redis: Acquire vote lock
    Redis-->>Vote: Lock acquired

    Vote->>DB: Check existing final vote

    alt Final vote already submitted
        DB-->>Vote: Existing vote found
        Vote-->>WS: Duplicate vote rejected
        WS-->>Client: Vote already submitted
    else No existing final vote
        DB-->>Vote: No vote found
        Vote->>DB: Save verdict, reason and explanation
        Vote->>Redis: Mark juror as voted
        Vote-->>WS: Vote accepted
        WS-->>Client: Vote recorded
    end

    Vote->>Redis: Count submitted votes

    alt Fewer than required votes and timer active
        Redis-->>Vote: Waiting for remaining jurors
        Vote-->>Room: Voting still in progress
    else All votes submitted or timer expired
        Redis-->>Vote: Voting complete
        Vote->>Room: Close voting phase
        Room->>Result: Calculate room verdict

        Result->>DB: Read valid final votes
        DB-->>Result: Jury votes and reasons

        Result->>Result: Aggregate guilty and not-guilty votes
        Result->>Result: Aggregate selected reasons
        Result->>Result: Apply configured verdict rule

        Result->>Case: Fetch expected legal outcome
        Case-->>Result: Legal verdict and explanation

        Result->>DB: Save result summary
        Result->>Analytics: Publish completed-session event
        Result-->>Room: Final result prepared

        Room-->>WS: Broadcast jury result
        WS-->>Client: Show vote distribution
        WS-->>Client: Show reason distribution
        WS-->>Client: Reveal legal explanation
    end